#: scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89417d225f1cfb54520bc45da67cbc4c1268fd4e9006bec439362a702eb6f512
#. default-sha256: 699431605d49531e498ae0ac6d5f1f2ba11eadf8c1ce9ac87905318934f6d95d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Approximately a week had passed since then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那之后，⟪k:3⟫又过了大概一周的时间。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95ced21b8605f22a1b4439ed015146263d6ed1c0ba6e3305c0cea735bb6f2c9a
#. default-sha256: d7435e96269bb35d8baffa9ae310e00ecce3f031400dbcb3f1d38550394a35da
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl was, as usual, spending her time in her room reading, staying inside "
"the house. ⟪k:1⟫Then, Maria barged in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她像往常一样闭门不出，⟪k:1⟫只是在房间里读书打发时间的时候，⟪k:2⟫玛利亚慌里慌张地飞奔而入。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ce633a77fd73712731e71343029d10371bcde5c82f51f70b6bf193af2bfa4c5
#. default-sha256: d2d3fd5ca2621722b25e4d1b1361574cb3614707f52bdffaf50346dc0fc321fd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madam! ⟪k:4⟫Madam!⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫夫人——⟪k:4⟫夫人！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edb1a2062b05dc776e07ca07b0cf5a9d713887fa8cc43199e8fdb0ff486bc077
#. default-sha256: 9573806bea50de620ba8f862ed6299e97399e797d117dd2aec986532113a5cfa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh my. You’re out of breath. What happened?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫嘛……⟪k:8⟫怎么了吗？⟪k:9⟫ 这么气喘吁吁的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdea0876981e2f9a448626b47cf68569f7a70c269a1863772534c6d1b6b1c594
#. default-sha256: 0be97cc7779e6d1531093ab454414d649b6c60ea0906a07e71af32e05431e6b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“What happened” is we have a ⟪k:2⟫big problem⟪k:3⟫!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Th-⟪k:6⟫The garden... ⟪k:7⟫"
"The rose garden!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不是问怎么了的时候！⟪k:2⟫糟糕了啊！ ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫蔷、⟪k:5⟫蔷薇园被……⟪k:6⟫蔷薇园被！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba90f42b4ed3ddf16270a11a4523caff1507747e59459e1dd772c595860370e1
#. default-sha256: b132acb6ca24c22a359b5ba0d94c282458c225eaa65bdb8cdb0d6f805376afbc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The garden...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫蔷薇园被……？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd056888523058987bfa1769cdbacc65b4bd2fe5029f2219ac5e66bc4403240f
#. default-sha256: e5998c28a4358b4a74f5039f87ec697d0c72b9abfadcf50c94e3db04772d554f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All the roses you put so much love and care into growing are being chopped down! We’ll "
"lose them all if we don’t hurry!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫夫人您最珍视的蔷薇们，⟪k:2⟫正在被铲除啊！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫这样下去的话，⟪k:5⟫会一朵不剩……！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2687d60f778a7dbed416362a917ee68f8861fb961cfda5622c025375db25cae7
#. default-sha256: f17d53820f34382e5e26f6b4f37e86e1cbb1689e94977ca3887558036adf06aa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d483945451424edd5d628356f4775c2e0cec990fb306041e754f59352b1caa5
#. default-sha256: ba1dd322b9d62f885438079228fad0b0de8e0742e3cb99426958ebb74d345a13
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Upon hearing the news, the White-Haired Girl dashed from her room and toward "
"the garden, with Maria following close behind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫听到玛利亚的话，⟪k:4⟫她也慌忙奔出房间，⟪k:5⟫赶去蔷薇园。⟪k:6⟫玛利亚则紧随其"
"后。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e444b275735477ee5f9313b32a94347079e540d7f19b35ec9ab97e71953bfa92
#. default-sha256: 4100e015e86912920f9c9a7c8e5bf8603817f257f034b1f8d0c1b1ee849459c5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When she arrived, she saw a dozen or so sweaty, rugged men at work, Jacopo "
"shouting orders."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫匆忙抵达蔷薇园时，⟪k:3⟫只见那里已经站着一群男人，⟪k:4⟫而雅各布正在指挥全局。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3e330746b93f19a22e725318ec0cfd096acca4e244973cfbc280ef1e678c41b
#. default-sha256: def94ab6abbc9f8adaadeb86d3e02bb94df3cbd5c2f9e2b49a8fa3326dd63370
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men clearly had no concept of how much a single flower was worth, no concern whatsoever "
"for their beauty..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫丝毫不能理解蔷薇之美、⟪k:1⟫满身大汗五大三粗的苦力们。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫他们连一朵蔷薇花有多么珍贵的价"
"值都不清楚——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2aa6dd260363f74fa64a43cf191713a634f1fa1b56898424429312d64d4cdf5
#. default-sha256: 21ec174f732f89873056f61fd64a9c9e23185cc60e3b22413cf05ffcef0179e1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫for they mercilessly, thoughtlessly hacked away at the shrubs like they were naught but "
"weeds."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只是杂乱地，⟪k:1⟫无情地，⟪k:2⟫好似对待杂草一般，⟪k:3⟫不断地铲除着蔷薇。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9875666857f0467be116d2705787e5df48008cb7f3b86f550266140c08de7366
#. default-sha256: 8181071130ee2281f825a4bf0df51375573efacc965e4c904c81187e94ec9cad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each flower they tore from the earth extinguished another of the many lives the White-Haired "
"Girl had put so much time and effort into tending for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫将白发少女亲自照料的花朵们的生命——⟪k:1⟫毫不留情地夺走。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e75072b042d54f8a4811fe91335419d6714379533961cb92af3f9c16ddd3b714
#. default-sha256: 15624f4d76065ceead8d9bdfd4d6b66a800638cd6e66ea16d3b3027131391e88
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, what are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫雅、⟪k:9⟫雅各布，⟪k:10⟫你在做什么——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3dde3db07e4d8c7d319e4eb841c2e255790bbcce00a246294569df445ffacff
#. default-sha256: c6c07409899c94e5d7b52ffbb43a0771a2d8e537f7033b147867de24e7bbab35
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, hello, Maria.⟪k:2⟫I didn’t expect you would come with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫什么啊，⟪k:2⟫是玛利亚吗。⟪k:3⟫没想到你也来了。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bdbdc10a56dec8dc877331319a6e3c0f09a37691b4e05d97fd6f67c2a56aea3
#. default-sha256: 380f987a93828583b193e1b3765e8d08b13489806b0222a3017b82c90e26ec68
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫would you do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫为什么……要把蔷薇园……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e2a02a5dbb4679a980c7147ce4b1543f861a95268350ff344e96b66a47c2982
#. default-sha256: 41dd0ea2260e95fe2fd8867573a163dd57e6a6188446e7cbfd8a8e8226ab60b4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why? Why, it goes without saying.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This house has no need of a garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫为什么？⟪k:2⟫那种事情，⟪k:3⟫不是显而易见吗。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫——因为不需要。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6733bba4df9da0629627527cae50baf142a882aeebec3a64fbc3fe0a6a432ed
#. default-sha256: 252d62890ba3e011566eb688d5e0726637656aa3c6087841b57f4aa419b751a1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Damn flowers have no place here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Might as well do something worthwhile with "
"the soil."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫这座屋子不需要花这种东西。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫比起种花，⟪k:4⟫还有更为有效的土地利用方式吧。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92ec96f0f148a82ae47c5c0ae07e885ccaa664fc7b643a4b8cf1e001760fd8ad
#. default-sha256: 7810ad9c20e19763d975cc326740f7f5cb2a38e3717d3a7523816521971027e6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A miniature railroad would be a better use of the space,⟪k:2⟫and certainly a great deal "
"easier on the eyes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I could even get my hands on some genuine wheels."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫干脆，⟪k:2⟫在这放个铁路模型吧，⟪k:3⟫没准能让精神爽快些。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫车轮的话可以用实物。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b579d3fe137439e80d5910163a7a06aa64b5d3f71fec1f05eca07e8a5ef8f5c
#. default-sha256: a9202c9eb1456fc2f9e26a6cad2904b4ec8788e85c85cbe3de588a278091887d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The same wheels being used on the revolutionary transcontinental railroad. ⟪k:1⟫Ten or "
"twenty years down the line, they’ll be worth a fortune."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫和值得纪念的横跨大陆铁道的列车同一个型号。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫想必几十年后也会相当值钱吧。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98d87405bc89abaceb26a57197ed692d69f9fe27db7725a4f730a07748dfeabf
#. default-sha256: 6b137dfe2e5e2847fce8ce1925a2bdab7f22d1632df1780031ea85f2cf044eab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……雅各布……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22186e7c54374ae0c5d77f4f2e26f8b528ad10c3fdb9e751481a79fcd3f02ec0
#. default-sha256: 30c046b1a2af85a6d2588a820f2cf053fd9994b1f1310c437e3ea107c8afe641
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You know... ⟪k:2⟫how much this garden meant to me, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……我……⟪k:2⟫很珍视这片花园，⟪k:3⟫你是知道的吧？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5dbbb3545f57e19e7a8230a3b41a7a3f1d395425ed12473a00931a040fa27fc
#. default-sha256: 6acd0ff8a216f6b9177e6ad878e4b3118cf11b596b1ee5db2e00e9d234551ad1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e848742a8a8a725eacc444fdb8ecbdc045af39e9fc8832441403b4c5de1b0e52
#. default-sha256: 046646f2aa70900e5e838e4014ce9eadbad70c4d7cc72f2229def1ae3e811eb1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Did it honestly have no place here?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Flowers have a calming effect on people. "
"They give you peace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫这是没用的东西吗……⟪k:2⟫花可以让人心情沉静下来。⟪k:3⟫可以给予人们内心的安宁。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85937a5f7315695752cb3f9dae4684490d5ecd5f8e929f31bc5ed00006764de5
#. default-sha256: 5c68f34bd569bd56bcdcf2ca471b9927144fd6bb3fd5ed3a6a623e546a50a50e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They are not, by any means, worthless—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫绝对，⟪k:1⟫不是没用的东西——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569
