msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So you’re saying that white rose was your passive-aggressive way of telling me to “calm "
"down”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那么，⟪k:2⟫那朵白蔷薇——⟪k:3⟫是在告诉我要「冷静下来」和你的厌恶之情吗？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_17B55CEE_966A_4E2A_A7B5_113B47328E10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9389c5f5e7a47fae0baa2366b405edf4829cbcc8d044aed664db41c62418cebb
