msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—! Not at all! I simply thought you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………！⟪k:2⟫不是的，⟪k:3⟫那个是，⟪k:4⟫是为了你——！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B2DBEF9_7106_4D29_BF8C_F5C7BB17FF43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaf736441d0322f151039e12bad2d55f2ddf50bd4e9a1976d674f0c9795cccb6
