msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the end of the day, you’re just using them for your own purposes—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫to trick "
"and deceive."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫反正，⟪k:2⟫你也不过是在利用花达成目的而已吧。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫用这种东西，⟪k:5⟫来扰乱他人。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F751B1C5_87D9_495F_A07A_86AA8933AF31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b0265a0c018f93a67943ae8daf66327bc626737a878a519b7356814fc572ee2
