msgid "⟪k:0⟫To you, this rose garden was nothing but—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫反正你肯定，⟪k:1⟫在这蔷薇园里——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_64914167_22B4_43EA_BF92_D7F19BC0D2AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
