msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hmph. “Gone too far”? This is ⟪k:2⟫my⟪k:3⟫ mansion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫What I do with my property "
"is my business."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……哼，⟪k:2⟫过分吗。⟪k:3⟫总而言之，⟪k:4⟫这屋子是我的地盘。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫我的资产我要怎么使"
"用，⟪k:7⟫都是我的自由。"

