msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Get back inside, now. You too, Maria."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫赶紧回房间去。⟪k:2⟫你也是，⟪k:3⟫玛利亚。"

